li","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p006","quote":"郅都遷爲中尉。丞相條侯至貴倨也，而都揖丞相。是時民樸，畏罪自重，而都獨先嚴酷，致行法不避貴戚，列侯宗室見都側目而視，號曰「蒼鷹」。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依原文區分授任、貶任與用稱；未明日期保持未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。敘事時長不反推公元年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji122-006","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","title":"鴈門太守","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p007","quote":"臨江王徴詣中尉府對簿，臨江王欲得刀筆爲書謝上，而都禁吏不予。魏其侯使人以閒與臨江王。臨江王旣爲書謝上，因自殺。竇太后聞之，怒，以危法中都，都免歸家。孝景帝乃使使持節拜都爲鴈門太守，而便道之官，得以便宜從事。匈奴素聞郅都節，居邊，爲引兵去，竟郅都死不近鴈門。匈奴至爲偶人象郅都，令騎馳射莫能中，見憚如此。匈奴患之。竇太后乃竟中都以漢法。景帝曰：「都忠臣。」欲釋之。竇太后曰：「臨江王獨非忠臣邪？」於是遂斬郅都。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji122-006:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p007","start":85,"end":89,"surface":"鴈門太守","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m007-0024","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p007","quote":"臨江王徴詣中尉府對簿，臨江王欲得刀筆爲書謝上，而都禁吏不予。魏其侯使人以閒與臨江王。臨江王旣爲書謝上，因自殺。竇太后聞之，怒，以危法中都，都免歸家。孝景帝乃使使持節拜都爲鴈門太守，而便道之官，得以便宜從事。匈奴素聞郅都節，居邊，爲引兵去，竟郅都死不近鴈門。匈奴至爲偶人象郅都，令騎馳射莫能中，見憚如此。匈奴患之。竇太后乃竟中都以漢法。景帝曰：「都忠臣。」欲釋之。竇太后曰：「臨江王獨非忠臣邪？」於是遂斬郅都。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依原文區分授任、貶任與用稱；未明日期保持未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。敘事時長不反推公元年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji122-001","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"楊","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p003","quote":"郅都者，楊人也。以郎事孝文帝。孝景時，都爲中郎將，敢直諫，面折大臣於朝。嘗從入上林，賈姬如廁，野彘卒入廁。上目都，都不行。上欲自持兵救賈姬，都伏上前曰：「亡一姬復一姬進，天下所少寧賈姬等乎？陛下縱自輕，柰宗廟太后何！」上還，彘亦去。太后聞之，賜都金百斤，由此重郅都。"}],"source_term":"楊人也","interpretation_note":"人物介紹明示原籍，保留底本原地名；不推現代轄區或出生地，任官所在地另待分類。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p002","text":"髙后時，酷吏獨有侯封，刻轢宗室，侵辱功臣。呂氏已敗，遂（禽）［夷］侯封之家。孝景時，晁錯以刻深頗用術輔其資，而七國之亂，發怒於錯，錯卒以被戮。其後有郅都、寧成之屬。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"髙后","kind":"person","person_id":"g78_bf1_b8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"侯封","kind":"person","person_id":"08g_qtm_hda","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"宗室","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"功臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"呂氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0033","start":33,"end":37,"surface":"侯封之家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"av9_5kt_rys","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"z6w_dj2_cmc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"z6w_dj2_cmc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"z6w_dj2_cmc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m002-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"郅都","kind":"pe