rson","person_id":"av9_5kt_rys","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m004-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"都","kind":"person","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m004-0037","start":37,"end":41,"surface":"瞯氏首惡","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m004-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"郡守","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m004-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"都","kind":"person","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p005","text":"都爲人勇，有氣力，公廉，不發私書，問遺無所受，請寄無所聽。常自稱曰：「已倍親而仕，身固當奉職死節官下，終不顧妻子矣。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m005-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"都","kind":"person","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m005-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"親","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m005-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p006","text":"郅都遷爲中尉。丞相條侯至貴倨也，而都揖丞相。是時民樸，畏罪自重，而都獨先嚴酷，致行法不避貴戚，列侯宗室見都側目而視，號曰「蒼鷹」。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"郅都","kind":"person","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m006-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"wzy_kri_13n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m006-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"wzy_kri_13n"